  "raw_html": "<button type='button' role='link' class='btn btn-link p-0 text-start' id='link_5' aria-label=\" State of Uttar Pradesh and Ors.  versus Bhawana Mishra  pdf\"  class='noToken' href='#' onclick=javascript:open_pdf('5','2026','2026_1_409_423','2026INSC38'); ><font size='4'> <strong>STATE OF UTTAR PRADESH AND ORS. <span class='fst-italic'> versus </span>BHAWANA MISHRA  </strong>- <span class='escrText'>[2026] 1 S.C.R. 409</span><span class='ncDisplay'>2026 INSC 38</span><input type='hidden' id='cnr' value=ESCR010000172026></button></font><br><strong>Coram : RAJESH BINDAL<sup style=\"color: #268e97;font-size: 22px;top: 0;\" class=\"tooltip-sup\" data-tooltip=\"Author\">*</sup>, MANMOHAN</strong><br> Issue for Consideration Issue arose as to whether on mere admission in a course, right is conferred for appointment on the post of Ayurvedic Staff Nurse. Headnotes&dagger; Service law &ndash; Appointment &ndash; Post of Ayurvedic Staff Nurse &ndash; Advertisement inviting application for the admitted and thereafter passed out from government institutions between 2015- 19 &ndash; Representation before the competent authority seeking appointment, however was rejected &ndash; Respondent then filed writ petition &ndash; Case of the appellant-State that earlier there were only 20 seats<br><strong class='caseDetailsTD' ><span style='color:#212F3D' > Decision Date :</span><font color='green'> 08-01-2026</font><span style='color:#212F3D' > | Case No :</span><font color='green'> CIVIL APPEAL No. 14250/2025</font><span style='color:#212F3D' > | Disposal Nature :</span><font color='green'> Appeal(s) allowed</font>   <span style='color:#212F3D' > |  Bench :</span><font color='green'> 2 Judges</font></strong><div class='row my-1 mt-2 border bg-light'><div class='col-auto'><a href='#' class='btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm my-1' onclick=open_splitview('5','2026','2026_1_409_423','2026INSC38','S')><i <i class='fas fa-columns me-2'></i>Split view</a></div><div class='col-auto